WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:10.000
[Appa grunting softly]

00:30.000 --> 00:32.208
I'm such an idiot, Appa.

00:32.291 --> 00:34.333
[Appa grunts]

00:34.416 --> 00:36.541
Why was I such a jerk to her?

00:37.125 --> 00:38.541
[Appa grunts]

00:38.625 --> 00:41.125
I told her I didn't need her.

00:41.208 --> 00:42.750
[Appa grunts]

00:42.833 --> 00:44.625
Practically yelled it at her.

00:44.708 --> 00:45.750
[Appa grunts]

00:47.041 --> 00:48.666
Why'd I do that?

00:48.750 --> 00:50.583
[Appa grunts]

00:52.416 --> 00:53.958
Words made of air.

00:55.541 --> 00:56.750
Airbend.

00:59.208 --> 01:01.208
Why not words bend?

01:01.291 --> 01:03.208
[Appa grunts]

01:04.791 --> 01:07.583
Wait a minute. There's a way out of this.

01:07.666 --> 01:09.666
I just have to say…

01:12.458 --> 01:13.666
I'm sorry.

01:14.166 --> 01:15.625
[Appa grunts]

01:18.250 --> 01:19.500
Is Katara…

01:20.541 --> 01:21.541
[Sokka] Uh…

01:22.041 --> 01:26.958
Right. Um, does the bluebell have
a cheese dumpling

01:27.041 --> 01:28.583
that laments the elbow leech?

01:28.666 --> 01:31.291
It's okay. The Dai Li
that was spying on us is gone now.

01:31.375 --> 01:33.208
-No one's within earshot.
-What was that?

01:33.291 --> 01:35.791
-I was using the code words.
-Didn't you get the updated list?

01:35.875 --> 01:37.708
You updated the code word list again?

01:37.791 --> 01:40.791
Yes! 'Cause the Dai Li have been
crawling all over the villa,

01:40.875 --> 01:43.541
trying to catch us talking about stuff,
and they might break the code!

01:43.625 --> 01:45.166
No one can break the code.

01:45.250 --> 01:47.041
I know the code. I can't even break it.

01:47.125 --> 01:49.541
Guys, it doesn't matter.
Momo ate the new list anyway.

01:49.625 --> 01:51.875
He ate it for security purposes.

01:51.958 --> 01:55.791
-I was trying to ask if Katara's here.
-She left early to meet with General Sung.

01:55.875 --> 01:59.000
She's very positive in the jing
about this new mission.

01:59.083 --> 02:01.250
I think she felt bad
about losing track of Joo Dee.

02:01.333 --> 02:03.083
Joo Dee's a master spy.
Who could blame her?

02:03.166 --> 02:07.250
Yeah, it's, uh, totally a good thing
that we were all super nice to her

02:07.333 --> 02:11.250
and, uh, thanked her
for all of her hard work and dedication.

02:11.333 --> 02:12.750
Okay, I did not do that at all.

02:12.833 --> 02:14.416
-Was I supposed to do that?
-No.

02:15.250 --> 02:16.416
What about Professor Zei?

02:16.500 --> 02:18.958
Does he have more information
about the Spirit Library?

02:19.041 --> 02:21.791
He may have a scroll
that says where the entrance used to be.

02:21.875 --> 02:25.708
We're sure that something in this library
tells us when the comet is coming?

02:25.791 --> 02:26.833
[Sokka] Legend has it,

02:26.916 --> 02:30.333
it has the greatest repository
of knowledge in the universe.

02:31.625 --> 02:32.791
So maybe.

02:33.875 --> 02:36.791
Right now, the best plan is
to get the information for the Earth King.

02:36.875 --> 02:38.958
Anyway, I better get going.

02:39.041 --> 02:40.875
I gotta keep up appearances
with Long Feng.

02:40.958 --> 02:43.583
Why keep up the act?
He knows you know he's lying, right?

02:44.500 --> 02:50.041
Sure, but if I keep doing what he asks,
he'll think I'm scared

02:50.125 --> 02:53.916
because I know that he knows
that I know he knows.

02:54.000 --> 02:56.208
And that's exactly
what I want him to think.

02:57.666 --> 02:59.416
Wait, was that the new code?

02:59.916 --> 03:00.750
No.

03:00.833 --> 03:01.750
[door opens]

03:01.833 --> 03:03.833
[dramatic music playing]

03:12.708 --> 03:14.708
[mysterious music playing]

03:18.625 --> 03:19.625
[music fades]

03:19.708 --> 03:21.708
[indistinct chatter]

03:34.625 --> 03:35.625
[Sung] Were you followed?

03:36.791 --> 03:37.750
[Katara] No.

03:38.458 --> 03:39.666
Any luck with our friend?

03:39.750 --> 03:42.250
[Sung] I've been unable
to locate your mechanist.

03:42.750 --> 03:46.208
Do you have a plan to tell the Earth King
about the comet without Zei?

03:46.291 --> 03:47.750
It's in the works.

03:48.333 --> 03:49.958
And what about an attack strategy?

03:50.916 --> 03:54.500
The Avatar was the key to victory
in the Northern Water Tribes.

03:55.375 --> 03:57.833
If we're going to take the war
to the Fire Nation,

03:57.916 --> 03:59.750
we will need his power.

03:59.833 --> 04:01.916
Yeah, he's… he's working on that too.

04:04.791 --> 04:06.791
I know you and your friends
have been through a lot,

04:06.875 --> 04:10.416
but you haven't faced
someone like Long Feng before.

04:10.500 --> 04:13.833
A villain who deals in fear and secrets

04:14.375 --> 04:17.583
can cut the heart from his enemy
without lifting a finger.

04:19.458 --> 04:24.166
I am rallying support from others
to stand with Aang against Long Feng.

04:24.791 --> 04:27.291
Our lives will be on the line
when he talks to the king,

04:27.375 --> 04:28.833
and yours may be too.

04:31.791 --> 04:33.666
I promise we will be ready.

05:00.208 --> 05:01.791
I wasn't followed.

05:05.041 --> 05:06.333
Please tell me you have it?

05:06.875 --> 05:09.000
Your dubiety is mithering, sir.

05:09.666 --> 05:10.583
[chuckles]

05:11.833 --> 05:15.625
Now, this is from personal letters
of Yao Xiaobo, a legendary scholar

05:15.708 --> 05:19.208
renowned more for his taste for adventure
than his research.

05:19.708 --> 05:20.875
A hero of mine.

05:21.750 --> 05:25.583
For generations,
the library stood outside of Ba Sing Se,

05:25.666 --> 05:29.750
a resource for humans
who sought knowledge for knowledge's sake.

05:29.833 --> 05:30.708
[Sokka] Hmm.

05:31.333 --> 05:36.083
To enter, one had only to offer a piece
of their own knowledge to the collection.

05:36.166 --> 05:39.166
The librarian, Wan Shi Tong,

05:39.250 --> 05:42.708
oversaw the free exchange of wisdom,
and harmony ruled.

05:43.583 --> 05:46.250
When the halls were sullied
by warmongering humans,

05:46.333 --> 05:48.833
Wan Shi Tong rent existence itself

05:48.916 --> 05:51.750
and folded his library
out of the human plane,

05:52.416 --> 05:55.833
leaving a spiritual scar on the land.

05:57.458 --> 05:59.375
-A spiritual scar?
-[Zei] Mmm.

05:59.458 --> 06:01.791
I think we've seen one of these before.

06:01.875 --> 06:05.416
Seen? I thought it was a metaphor.
It… it's real?

06:06.083 --> 06:10.333
[scoffs] It's a real metaphor, all right.
We went through one into the Spirit World.

06:10.916 --> 06:12.791
-It's kind of terrible, actually.
-[Zei] Huh.

06:13.708 --> 06:16.458
Well, I'd say this one must be somewhere
in the Lower Ring.

06:16.541 --> 06:19.500
That's the area
that has undergone the most growth.

06:19.583 --> 06:22.250
Well, at least now we have an idea
of where we're headed.

06:24.500 --> 06:25.500
So,

06:26.291 --> 06:28.750
I can come if you find it.

06:28.833 --> 06:30.166
Yeah!

06:30.250 --> 06:33.625
I mean, without you,
we wouldn't have any idea where to start.

06:37.333 --> 06:38.875
[Katar] So once we find the spirit scar,

06:38.958 --> 06:42.291
Aang should be able to meditate everyone
into the Spirit World again.

06:42.375 --> 06:45.208
Okay, I'm sorry. What is a spirit scar?

06:46.208 --> 06:48.500
It's a place where the veil is thin
between worlds.

06:49.000 --> 06:52.083
A place that feels a little haunted.

06:52.583 --> 06:56.541
It's like walking on thin ice,
but the ice is… existence?

06:57.208 --> 07:01.333
So, haunted, between worlds, thin ice.

07:01.833 --> 07:04.833
Three things I've avoided my entire life.
Can't wait!

07:04.916 --> 07:08.708
Tomorrow, we'll split up
and search the Lower Ring till we find it.

07:09.541 --> 07:13.916
Be careful asking around.
We can't trust anyone from Ba Sing Se.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.125
[Sokka] Hmm.

07:15.208 --> 07:17.625
What about people outside Ba Sing Se,
like the refugees?

07:18.833 --> 07:20.791
I'm not sure how well
they know the streets,

07:20.875 --> 07:22.125
but we can trust them.

07:23.625 --> 07:25.500
How did it go with General Sung?

07:26.000 --> 07:27.583
[Katara] She's nervous.

07:27.666 --> 07:29.791
She wants to know
what your attack strategy is

07:29.875 --> 07:31.333
to fight the Fire Nation.

07:31.416 --> 07:33.541
[scoffs] Of course she does.

07:33.625 --> 07:36.791
-They always want a big attack plan.
-They want the Avatar State.

07:37.375 --> 07:40.208
I know, but… I can't.

07:40.291 --> 07:43.833
Maybe the library will have another idea
for how to fight back.

07:43.916 --> 07:47.208
Yeah. Yeah, I'm sure they'll have
information about the Fire Nation there.

07:48.208 --> 07:49.333
Someone's coming!

07:49.833 --> 07:51.458
-[Toph clears throat]
-[Sokka] Oh, uh…

07:51.541 --> 07:52.666
[knock on door]

07:53.250 --> 07:54.125
Toph Beifong?

07:54.208 --> 07:56.083
-Hide the map!
-[Katara] Just give it to me.

07:56.166 --> 07:58.791
Let me guess. Proposal, right?

07:59.416 --> 08:03.375
Tall, business prodigy, handsome.

08:03.458 --> 08:04.791
As if that matters.

08:04.875 --> 08:07.708
Um… no.

08:10.916 --> 08:13.000
"From the desk of Lady Beifong."

08:14.000 --> 08:17.333
"Toph, I'll be arriving
in Ba Sing Se tomorrow."

08:18.125 --> 08:22.041
"The only purpose of my trip is
to see you and make things right."

08:22.125 --> 08:24.250
"Please, don't ignore me."

08:25.041 --> 08:27.041
"With love, your mother."

08:27.125 --> 08:29.125
[mysterious music playing]

08:37.708 --> 08:39.166
[thunder rumbles]

08:42.083 --> 08:45.583
So you're the ones who captured
General Tran of the Fire Nation.

08:46.458 --> 08:48.375
We're very grateful for your assistance.

08:49.166 --> 08:53.291
But I am a little surprised
it's you who escorted this prisoner here.

08:53.791 --> 08:58.416
Suki determined, as our leader,
she needed to maintain a vigilant watch.

08:58.916 --> 09:02.208
The Fire Nation are unpredictable,
as you know.

09:03.875 --> 09:06.416
[Zei] I understand
you want to see the Avatar.

09:06.500 --> 09:12.333
However, the Avatar and his companions are
a little preoccupied with matters of state

09:12.416 --> 09:13.833
and won't be available.

09:13.916 --> 09:15.208
But in the meantime,

09:15.291 --> 09:17.875
we can provide housing
in the city for you.

09:20.666 --> 09:24.208
Thank you, General Sung,
for your hospitality.

09:24.708 --> 09:26.333
I do need to warn you.

09:26.416 --> 09:29.125
The city is its own nation-state.

09:29.625 --> 09:33.083
Quite independent
from the military forces here at the Wall.

09:33.166 --> 09:34.958
I'm not sure I understand.

09:36.958 --> 09:40.416
They do not discuss the war
inside the city.

09:42.500 --> 09:46.083
We ask that you keep
our military operations confidential.

09:48.125 --> 09:50.750
You can rely on us
for the utmost discretion.

09:55.458 --> 09:56.625
[door opens]

09:57.333 --> 09:59.333
[indistinct chatter]

10:01.291 --> 10:02.708
[sizzling]

10:04.875 --> 10:07.291
-I'll be home late again, Uncle.
-Oh, Zuko!

10:07.375 --> 10:09.666
I have jook with bread and egg.

10:10.458 --> 10:12.750
I'll eat on the way to work.
I don't wanna be late.

10:12.833 --> 10:14.708
I wanted to discuss that, actually.

10:14.791 --> 10:19.041
The owner of the tea shop is retiring,
and well, if you want,

10:19.125 --> 10:22.750
I can offer you a good job
with fair hours.

10:23.666 --> 10:25.958
No, but thank you.

10:26.041 --> 10:27.458
I… I have to go.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.375
[sighs]

10:31.375 --> 10:32.583
Excuse me.

10:33.375 --> 10:34.333
Right.

10:35.250 --> 10:37.208
You, hey. Um…

10:38.125 --> 10:42.125
Do you know of any, like,
haunted houses around here?

10:47.333 --> 10:48.458
Didn't think so.

10:52.125 --> 10:54.125
[sniffing]

10:59.875 --> 11:03.791
[dishware clattering]

11:07.458 --> 11:09.458
[sniffing]

11:13.833 --> 11:16.166
Is that… pear and ginger?

11:20.375 --> 11:23.208
[Iroh] Yes, it is.
I just added it to the menu.

11:23.708 --> 11:24.541
Allow me.

11:39.958 --> 11:42.541
It's meant to be quite therapeutic.

11:53.666 --> 11:55.041
[inhales deeply]

12:02.416 --> 12:03.625
[inhales deeply]

12:05.916 --> 12:06.833
[exhales]

12:09.583 --> 12:10.750
This is wonderful.

12:11.250 --> 12:12.166
[Iroh] Hmm.

12:15.000 --> 12:18.000
My mother used to brew this for me
when I was little.

12:18.750 --> 12:22.041
Whenever I'd get sick, she'd stop working.

12:22.875 --> 12:25.125
She insisted she'd make it herself.

12:26.458 --> 12:28.333
She didn't like the way the cooks did it.

12:29.750 --> 12:32.416
"Too dry," she'd complain.

12:33.958 --> 12:36.625
I never knew that a drink could be dry.

12:39.666 --> 12:42.208
And she'd just sit with me,

12:42.708 --> 12:47.250
reading, to make sure
that I drank every last drop.

12:50.125 --> 12:52.583
It sounds like
you have a very loving mother.

12:53.583 --> 12:54.958
No.

12:56.208 --> 12:58.541
No, my parents are not good people.

13:02.416 --> 13:05.041
I'm thinking about
never speaking to them again.

13:06.583 --> 13:07.500
[Iroh inhales]

13:09.708 --> 13:10.833
[sighs]

13:12.250 --> 13:15.708
It's hard when you're young to understand.

13:17.583 --> 13:20.000
Navigating life is complicated.

13:21.458 --> 13:26.416
Most of the mistakes we made were choices
that felt right in the moment.

13:26.500 --> 13:27.541
[Toph] Well,

13:28.250 --> 13:31.708
did you ever choose money
over people's lives?

13:32.916 --> 13:34.375
That's what my parents did.

13:36.208 --> 13:39.250
I made lots of choices
to protect my family.

13:40.375 --> 13:42.791
Now I can see that some of them were

13:44.125 --> 13:45.083
misguided.

13:46.625 --> 13:50.791
But still, I would choose
to protect my nephew over anyone else.

13:54.458 --> 13:56.041
Do you think that's what he wants?

14:02.375 --> 14:03.416
I'm not sure.

14:05.083 --> 14:07.291
Do your parents know what you want?

14:08.875 --> 14:09.875
I think so.

14:13.000 --> 14:18.291
As we get older, we have to find the words
to tell each other what we want.

14:19.583 --> 14:21.250
Even if those words are hurtful.

14:22.375 --> 14:23.875
[Toph sighs]

14:26.041 --> 14:29.375
I don't even know
if I wanna give them a chance.

14:31.041 --> 14:33.458
Not unless they show
that they could change.

14:36.875 --> 14:39.333
It takes true courage to change.

14:41.541 --> 14:43.541
I would say it doesn't hurt to ask,

14:43.625 --> 14:49.291
but I guess sometimes
asking is what hurts the most.

15:01.416 --> 15:02.375
[sighs]

15:05.250 --> 15:06.916
[clears throat] Um…

15:08.416 --> 15:09.416
Anyway,

15:10.750 --> 15:12.000
thanks for the drink.

15:13.250 --> 15:15.666
And the advice, of course.

15:15.750 --> 15:17.041
Thank you.

15:17.541 --> 15:21.791
After all, sharing tea
with a fascinating stranger

15:21.875 --> 15:23.875
is one of life's true delights.

15:27.458 --> 15:28.750
[Toph] Right.

15:28.833 --> 15:30.041
Stranger.

15:40.708 --> 15:43.541
These are your accommodations
for your stay.

15:43.625 --> 15:46.875
After you settle in,
I can show you to the marketplace.

15:51.666 --> 15:53.708
Thank you very much, Joo Dee.

15:54.833 --> 15:58.333
-Pardon the interruption.
-Cultural Minister, what an honor.

15:59.333 --> 16:00.541
Just a quick visit.

16:01.458 --> 16:05.583
I could not miss the opportunity
to meet the famed Kyoshi Warriors.

16:06.166 --> 16:09.541
I am Long Feng,
Cultural Minister to the Earth King.

16:09.625 --> 16:10.500
A humble gift.

16:12.000 --> 16:14.625
Delicacies from your home island.

16:17.666 --> 16:19.250
Cultural Minister,

16:19.333 --> 16:22.166
it is an honor and a relief
to meet a nobleman

16:22.250 --> 16:24.208
who reports directly to the king.

16:24.291 --> 16:28.500
The Kyoshi Warriors pledge
absolute fealty to his grace.

16:29.458 --> 16:31.375
His Majesty will be pleased.

16:32.500 --> 16:35.000
My warrior sisters and I
undertook great risk

16:35.083 --> 16:37.708
to capture the High Commander
of the Fire Nation forces,

16:37.791 --> 16:40.875
and we want to be sure
that the Earth King himself

16:40.958 --> 16:43.000
has a chance to interrogate this asset.

16:43.083 --> 16:47.708
I'm sure he will be kept abreast
of the information gathered

16:47.791 --> 16:50.458
from the prisoner who is being held…

16:50.541 --> 16:52.250
By General Sung.

16:53.916 --> 16:56.750
They cautioned us to be discreet
about what we say in the city,

16:56.833 --> 16:58.458
so I do hope I haven't overstepped.

16:58.541 --> 17:00.041
Of course not.

17:00.541 --> 17:03.916
Please, let Joo Dee know
if you need anything.

17:05.666 --> 17:07.458
Joo Dee, a quick word?

17:15.375 --> 17:17.375
[suspenseful music playing]

17:19.291 --> 17:21.458
[Azula] What did you make
of his body language, Ty Lee?

17:21.541 --> 17:24.750
He almost popped a blood vessel
when you said General Sung's name.

17:24.833 --> 17:28.125
He clearly didn't know
about Tran being held prisoner.

17:29.500 --> 17:31.333
You really think he'll tell the king?

17:33.208 --> 17:35.666
Information is power to someone like him.

17:35.750 --> 17:39.041
[suspenseful music swells, then fades]

17:40.875 --> 17:41.833
[Jet sighs]

17:44.166 --> 17:45.666
You treat all your merch like that?

17:45.750 --> 17:47.916
You're gonna melt it down
for scrap anyway.

17:48.000 --> 17:50.708
Unless you're… you're buying a teapot
for your granny.

17:53.041 --> 17:54.750
-Fifteen.
-Twenty.

17:54.833 --> 17:56.791
Sixteen. Nineteen.

17:56.875 --> 17:58.791
Seventeen. Seventeen and a half.

17:58.875 --> 18:00.833
-[gasps] Deal.
-[Jet] Deal.

18:03.000 --> 18:04.083
-[man] Look out!
-[whooshing]

18:07.625 --> 18:08.750
Octopus shark!

18:09.250 --> 18:10.833
-Ah!
-[knife clatters]

18:10.916 --> 18:11.750
Hey, Jet.

18:11.833 --> 18:13.208
[tense music playing]

18:15.416 --> 18:17.000
[Jet groans] Again?

18:17.583 --> 18:18.625
You can go.

18:20.291 --> 18:21.416
[Jet] Traitor!

18:21.500 --> 18:24.333
Can't believe you defended those people
from the Fire Nation.

18:24.916 --> 18:27.000
What are you,
some kind of flame lover now?

18:29.666 --> 18:31.333
[Katara] I didn't see
any Firebenders there.

18:31.416 --> 18:34.166
Just a bunch of powerless people
being bullied by looters.

18:34.250 --> 18:36.208
I don't need a lecture from you.

18:36.291 --> 18:37.666
I know about that do-gooding crap

18:37.750 --> 18:39.416
you've been up to
in that disguise of yours.

18:40.000 --> 18:42.291
Healing the sick, feeding the poor.

18:42.375 --> 18:45.833
You should know, your little act
isn't changing anyone's lives.

18:50.166 --> 18:52.583
[sighs] I came here
because we need your help.

18:53.583 --> 18:57.583
I'm looking for a place in the Lower Ring,
and you know your way around the streets.

18:58.083 --> 18:59.750
It's for the war.

19:00.916 --> 19:01.916
Sorry.

19:02.875 --> 19:04.708
I'm not a freedom fighter anymore.

19:06.583 --> 19:07.625
Too risky.

19:08.958 --> 19:12.291
You hate the Fire Nation enough
to pick on a bunch of helpless people,

19:12.375 --> 19:14.666
but you can't do one thing
to fight the real enemy.

19:14.750 --> 19:18.625
No. Now, if you'll excuse me,
I have to go find a new buyer

19:18.708 --> 19:22.750
since you chased the last one off,
and I was kind of hoping to eat tonight.

19:26.041 --> 19:27.250
I'll buy it.

19:29.208 --> 19:31.416
I'll buy it if you can help us.

19:32.333 --> 19:33.583
I'll pay you double.

19:34.458 --> 19:35.958
Triple and it's a deal.

19:37.416 --> 19:42.041
Eight hours of walking and all we found
were those fried flour potatoes.

19:42.625 --> 19:44.208
Gave me indigestion.

19:44.958 --> 19:47.041
[Katara] Hey,
I got someone who could help.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.750
Jet?!

19:51.583 --> 19:53.833
Katara? How could you bring him here?

19:53.916 --> 19:55.208
Uh, who is this guy?

19:55.291 --> 19:56.875
-I'm Jet.
-He's a bad guy.

19:56.958 --> 19:58.500
He tried to kill Bumi.

19:58.583 --> 20:01.125
Hey, if you guys don't want my help,
I can just go.

20:01.208 --> 20:03.208
He knows where the spirit scar is.

20:03.291 --> 20:06.416
We don't need help from a terrorist
who tried to overthrow the government.

20:07.083 --> 20:09.500
Oh, wait, we're kind of trying
to overthrow the government now.

20:10.083 --> 20:12.083
I like him. He stands with attitude.

20:13.333 --> 20:14.500
[Aang scoffs]

20:15.583 --> 20:19.083
You hated him before.
Why are we supposed to trust him now?

20:19.166 --> 20:22.208
We don't need to trust him.
I'm not asking you to.

20:23.333 --> 20:25.041
You just need to trust me.

20:27.541 --> 20:30.041
[mysterious music playing]

20:30.125 --> 20:31.166
[sighs]

20:39.166 --> 20:40.208
[music fades]

20:40.291 --> 20:42.625
Oh, Zuko, you're home.

20:42.708 --> 20:44.833
I'm just heading out. Night shift.

20:45.458 --> 20:46.500
Not yet.

20:47.250 --> 20:48.666
Not until we talk.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.875
We can talk later.

20:49.958 --> 20:53.291
Zuko, we've put this off for too long.

20:54.083 --> 20:56.000
Sit down, please.

21:01.333 --> 21:02.250
[Zuko sighs]

21:04.625 --> 21:05.750
[sighs]

21:15.541 --> 21:17.375
Back on the farm, what you said…

21:17.458 --> 21:18.333
I…

21:19.458 --> 21:20.583
I was angry.

21:22.250 --> 21:25.458
It wasn't right to blame you
for what's happened to me.

21:25.541 --> 21:26.500
[Iroh] No.

21:27.208 --> 21:28.416
It was right.

21:29.375 --> 21:32.250
Everything you said was right.

21:34.000 --> 21:37.791
When my son died,
I ran from my responsibility.

21:38.750 --> 21:40.125
I should have stood up.

21:41.250 --> 21:43.916
Every day I saw my brother with the crown,

21:44.000 --> 21:45.083
I felt it.

21:46.208 --> 21:47.583
What he did to you.

21:49.916 --> 21:54.666
I've been trying to be a father to you
because I know how your father is.

21:55.500 --> 21:57.833
But I've also been trying to turn you

21:58.333 --> 22:02.583
into the man I hoped Lu Ten would be

22:03.458 --> 22:06.375
instead of helping you
become your own man.

22:08.750 --> 22:10.041
That wasn't right.

22:11.708 --> 22:12.875
I'm sorry.

22:17.458 --> 22:19.291
And now it's time to make up for it.

22:19.791 --> 22:22.125
I'm ready to face my mistakes

22:22.625 --> 22:23.791
and correct them.

22:25.208 --> 22:27.791
I must ask you, too, Zuko,

22:27.875 --> 22:31.375
to choose what kind of man you want to be.

22:31.875 --> 22:33.625
But choose for yourself.

22:34.708 --> 22:36.458
And whatever you choose,

22:36.541 --> 22:38.791
whatever path you walk down,

22:39.958 --> 22:41.916
I will always love you.

22:47.708 --> 22:49.708
[sentimental music playing]

23:07.875 --> 23:09.875
[indistinct chatter]

23:12.916 --> 23:16.916
You know, what we really need
are some aromatic bath salts.

23:17.000 --> 23:19.166
All of that roughing it, you know?

23:19.250 --> 23:21.791
Oh, yes. I know just the vendor.

23:23.500 --> 23:25.375
There's the grocer back there.

23:25.875 --> 23:27.125
And the bookish woman.

23:27.208 --> 23:28.625
[Mai] And Joo Dee is clearly a spy.

23:28.708 --> 23:30.583
This place is crawling.

23:31.250 --> 23:34.291
The military and the city rulers
are in a cold war,

23:34.375 --> 23:37.291
and order is maintained through
secret police and paranoia.

23:37.375 --> 23:41.416
Do you know what fuels
all of this distrust and animosity?

23:43.250 --> 23:44.458
Weakness.

23:45.791 --> 23:47.291
The Earth King is weak.

23:49.291 --> 23:51.750
Maybe under the influence
of some shadow ruler.

23:53.541 --> 23:56.916
If there is a shadow ruler,

23:57.000 --> 23:58.708
they would be the key.

23:58.791 --> 24:01.333
Might be open to listening to reason.

24:01.916 --> 24:04.958
As long as they're more afraid
of losing control than they are of me.

24:05.625 --> 24:07.416
That hardly seems possible.

24:07.500 --> 24:08.375
[Azula] Hmm.

24:10.708 --> 24:12.458
It'd be fairly simple to catch my brother

24:12.541 --> 24:14.791
if I had a network of spies
at my disposal.

24:17.750 --> 24:21.000
All we have to do now
is figure out who the shadow ruler is.

24:21.958 --> 24:23.375
How do we do that?

24:25.333 --> 24:28.166
Unfortunately, we're going to
have to do it the easy way.

24:30.583 --> 24:32.041
-Oh, Joo Dee?
-Yes?

24:33.750 --> 24:36.083
[screams]

24:38.708 --> 24:39.916
[door opens]

24:44.416 --> 24:45.541
[door closes]

24:45.625 --> 24:46.541
Hello.

24:47.166 --> 24:48.083
Again.

24:50.458 --> 24:52.000
I suspected it might be you.

24:53.791 --> 24:56.083
We have a lot to discuss.

24:56.791 --> 24:57.791
[Appa grunts]

24:57.875 --> 25:00.333
[Zei] So you're telling me
he bends the air around himself.

25:00.416 --> 25:04.166
[Aang] And us. That's why we don't swallow
any flies when we're riding on top of him.

25:04.250 --> 25:06.250
[Appa grunts]

25:19.708 --> 25:21.541
[Jet] Found this spot
when I first got here.

25:22.500 --> 25:23.541
Only stayed a night.

25:24.541 --> 25:25.583
Bad dreams.

25:29.166 --> 25:30.416
This is the place.

25:30.916 --> 25:32.750
I can almost feel it through the air.

25:33.750 --> 25:35.250
Thank you, Jet.

25:38.750 --> 25:40.625
[Katara] Job's done. So here.

25:41.500 --> 25:42.583
You can go now.

25:45.500 --> 25:46.958
So what happens now?

25:47.041 --> 25:48.583
[Sokka] Well, Aang's gonna meditate,

25:48.666 --> 25:52.625
we're gonna get pulled out of our bodies,
and Appa and Momo are gonna stand guard.

25:53.125 --> 25:55.125
[Appa grunts]

25:57.250 --> 25:59.166
[Zei] Well, this is quite exciting.

25:59.250 --> 26:02.375
So, you're just gonna float around?

26:02.458 --> 26:03.458
Like ghosts?

26:03.541 --> 26:04.666
[Aang] Not quite.

26:04.750 --> 26:06.958
We'll be solid,
but we won't be able to bend.

26:07.625 --> 26:10.375
You'll wanna step back.
You might accidentally get sucked in.

26:10.458 --> 26:12.208
So, hold on. No bending?

26:12.833 --> 26:14.583
It sounds like
you might need backup in there.

26:14.666 --> 26:17.333
Okay. Will you just
make up your mind already?

26:17.416 --> 26:18.833
Maybe I can help.

26:20.791 --> 26:23.333
All righty. Let's do this, guys.

26:25.291 --> 26:29.625
[suspenseful music fades in]

26:34.208 --> 26:36.208
[music intensifying]

26:47.583 --> 26:49.083
[whirring]

26:51.416 --> 26:53.708
[mysterious music playing]

27:02.458 --> 27:03.458
[Zei] I don't…

27:05.625 --> 27:06.791
I don't believe it.

27:08.208 --> 27:10.083
[Toph] There's something there.

27:12.041 --> 27:14.666
Something beyond the door.

27:14.750 --> 27:16.791
I can feel it.

27:16.875 --> 27:17.875
[Sokka] Feel what?

27:18.500 --> 27:20.500
[dramatic music playing]

27:35.125 --> 27:36.083
This.

28:05.083 --> 28:08.833
I've never been in
a building this big before.

28:10.166 --> 28:12.291
-You can feel it?
-[Toph] Yeah.

28:12.375 --> 28:13.708
I mean, I can't bend,

28:13.791 --> 28:18.541
but the acoustics and vibrations in here
are sweet.

28:26.166 --> 28:29.416
[creature] The library
is closed to humans!

28:34.291 --> 28:35.833
I said…

28:37.625 --> 28:40.541
Oh, it's you again.

28:41.666 --> 28:44.166
-You're that owl.
-The spirit of knowledge.

28:44.250 --> 28:47.041
My name is Wan Shi Tong,

28:47.125 --> 28:50.333
he who knows ten thousand things.

28:50.416 --> 28:52.000
You talk human now?

28:52.083 --> 28:54.541
[Wan Shi Tong] And yet
you still don't comprehend.

28:54.625 --> 28:57.708
This world is not for humans.

28:57.791 --> 29:01.708
You should've learned that
after your dalliance with Koh.

29:02.291 --> 29:05.750
Wan Shi Tong, I'm the bridge
between the human and Spirit World.

29:05.833 --> 29:07.375
Go home.

29:08.541 --> 29:10.458
I, Great Spirit,

29:10.541 --> 29:13.500
am Professor Zei, a fellow scholar and--

29:13.583 --> 29:15.083
I care not!

29:15.166 --> 29:17.875
This library has been off-limits to humans

29:17.958 --> 29:22.083
ever since firebending spies
turned an entire wing to ash

29:22.166 --> 29:24.833
because they feared the information within

29:24.916 --> 29:28.583
would be used to defeat them
on the battlefield.

29:28.666 --> 29:29.875
We wouldn't do that.

29:31.208 --> 29:32.708
I'm a friend of the Spirit World.

29:32.791 --> 29:36.458
I know of your misadventures, boy Avatar.

29:36.541 --> 29:40.750
The murder of Tui and the fury of La,

29:40.833 --> 29:43.416
the fury you harnessed

29:43.500 --> 29:45.791
to destroy your enemy.

29:45.875 --> 29:48.375
Your world is at war,

29:48.458 --> 29:51.833
and you desire to win that war.

29:51.916 --> 29:56.916
How could I trust
your intentions are pacific?

29:57.833 --> 29:58.916
What about the rule…

30:01.250 --> 30:05.458
that a person only need offer
their own worthy knowledge to be admitted?

30:12.250 --> 30:16.166
I offer this on our behalf.

30:17.083 --> 30:20.125
[Wan Shi Tong] Is this the map
that guided you here?

30:20.208 --> 30:21.125
It is.

30:23.000 --> 30:25.541
A worthy offering, Professor.

30:29.750 --> 30:34.166
Promise that no knowledge gained
within these walls

30:34.250 --> 30:38.000
will be used to harm anyone.

30:38.625 --> 30:40.166
You have our word.

30:43.666 --> 30:44.750
Very well.

30:44.833 --> 30:47.208
How will we find what we're looking for?

30:47.291 --> 30:49.000
[Wan Shi Tong] There are
library assistants.

30:49.083 --> 30:50.708
Perhaps you'll find one.

30:50.791 --> 30:53.541
But the library works in its own way.

30:53.625 --> 30:56.416
It may choose to show you what you want,

30:56.500 --> 31:00.250
but it will certainly lead you
to the knowledge that you need.

31:00.333 --> 31:01.291
[Aang gasps]

31:05.083 --> 31:08.541
Do not forget your promise!

31:16.083 --> 31:16.916
[Sokka groans]

31:17.875 --> 31:20.166
All right,
let's split up into teams of two.

31:20.250 --> 31:23.250
We need to find proof of the comet
and when it will be coming.

31:23.833 --> 31:24.750
[Sokka] Let's go.

31:27.541 --> 31:30.000
[Zei chuckles] Wow!

31:30.083 --> 31:31.166
This is…

31:32.416 --> 31:35.166
Whoa, this is incredible.

31:38.750 --> 31:40.250
Wait. [gasps]

31:40.833 --> 31:42.083
It can't be.

31:42.583 --> 31:43.458
It is!

31:43.958 --> 31:45.708
The collected essays of…

31:45.791 --> 31:46.875
No!

31:47.458 --> 31:49.333
Both editions! [chuckles]

31:49.833 --> 31:50.875
-[Sokka] Huh.
-[Zei] Oh.

31:50.958 --> 31:54.416
Personal accounts of the solitary travels
of Sun Wen Lei. [gasps]

31:54.500 --> 31:55.458
[Sokka] Professor Zei?

31:55.541 --> 31:57.083
Oh, I'm sorry. Um…

31:57.166 --> 32:00.333
I know. The comet first
and then onto these, uh, treasures.

32:00.416 --> 32:03.250
No, it's okay. If you wanna stop and read,
I can go ahead and look for--

32:03.333 --> 32:05.333
Oh, I'd like that very much, yes.

32:08.416 --> 32:09.416
Okay.

32:12.000 --> 32:12.833
Excuse me.

32:12.916 --> 32:15.083
Are you a library assistant?

32:19.416 --> 32:20.708
You're a fox.

32:22.291 --> 32:25.291
Oh, uh, I, uh… I knew another fox.

32:25.958 --> 32:28.333
Well, she was a white fox
in the Spirit World,

32:28.416 --> 32:30.333
but she was a human out there.

32:31.541 --> 32:33.250
Her name… her name was Yue.

32:33.750 --> 32:35.625
Uh, do you know her?

32:36.583 --> 32:38.333
She here? Is…

32:39.250 --> 32:41.750
This is the Spirit World.
She could be here, right?

32:49.541 --> 32:50.541
That feels like a yes.

32:53.125 --> 32:54.833
[snapping fingers]

32:56.333 --> 32:58.250
[Aang] This must be the Avatar section.

33:00.666 --> 33:01.625
[Toph] Let's see…

33:04.041 --> 33:04.875
[scoffs]

33:06.041 --> 33:06.875
Whoa.

33:08.333 --> 33:09.708
Raised characters?

33:10.208 --> 33:12.916
Man, this library rules. [chuckles]

33:15.708 --> 33:18.250
One of the previous Avatars
must've experienced the comet

33:18.333 --> 33:19.541
and knows what it does.

33:20.250 --> 33:22.916
All right, well, I'll get reading.

33:46.708 --> 33:48.583
The journals of the ancient.

33:49.583 --> 33:51.125
[Yangchen] That one was a decoy.

33:51.625 --> 33:52.791
Pure fiction.

33:53.791 --> 33:56.083
But you can ask me
whatever you want, Aang.

33:56.166 --> 33:58.166
[poignant music playing]

34:00.000 --> 34:01.375
Oh. [chuckles]

34:01.958 --> 34:05.708
I suppose you haven't seen
another Air Nomad in some time.

34:15.666 --> 34:16.875
[Jet] So,

34:18.541 --> 34:22.958
are we just supposed to read books
until we find an answer?

34:23.958 --> 34:24.875
I don't know.

34:31.708 --> 34:35.541
It's a bit of an odd section,
given how anti-war that bird's speech was.

34:36.166 --> 34:38.791
[Katara] There must be something in here
we're supposed to learn.

34:39.916 --> 34:41.750
How to win an unwinnable war?

34:47.166 --> 34:48.541
[Yangchen] So how are you, Aang?

34:49.041 --> 34:50.291
It's been hard.

34:51.083 --> 34:55.416
We brought these refugees to Ba Sing Se,
and when we got here,

34:56.125 --> 34:58.875
I trusted this guy, Long Feng.

34:58.958 --> 35:02.166
But he was a liar,
and the Great Comet's on the way back,

35:02.250 --> 35:04.291
and I don't feel like I can trust anyone.

35:04.833 --> 35:06.958
Feels like even my friends
are keeping things from me.

35:07.041 --> 35:10.833
I spent most of my life
dealing with spies and liars.

35:11.333 --> 35:15.291
If you need guidance on trusting people,
you've come to the right place.

35:18.791 --> 35:19.791
[chuckles]

35:20.791 --> 35:22.500
Man, she is something.

35:23.666 --> 35:25.500
-Finding my life entertaining?
-Oh jeez.

35:27.125 --> 35:28.000
Who are you?

35:28.083 --> 35:29.833
Kyoshi. Where's Aang?

35:30.666 --> 35:32.458
He's back there somewhere.

35:33.125 --> 35:35.000
I'm the earthbending teacher, by the way.

35:35.083 --> 35:36.125
But you're a child.

35:36.208 --> 35:37.625
Yeah, well, you're dead.

35:38.250 --> 35:39.833
Is this normal for you?

35:39.916 --> 35:43.666
Do you jump out of books all the time,
or is this just a Spirit Library thing?

35:43.750 --> 35:46.416
It's a being close to the Avatar thing.

35:48.625 --> 35:49.708
What's your name?

35:51.166 --> 35:52.000
Toph.

35:53.375 --> 35:54.333
Beifong.

35:55.500 --> 35:57.291
I dislike your family greatly.

35:57.750 --> 35:58.708
[Toph] Yeah, well,

35:59.958 --> 36:01.083
me too.

36:02.750 --> 36:04.833
[sighs] What do you want from the Avatar?

36:05.541 --> 36:08.333
I just want to teach him earthbending.

36:09.250 --> 36:11.791
I mean, I ran away
from my family to do it.

36:11.875 --> 36:14.250
Your family is not so easy to escape.

36:14.333 --> 36:16.625
[scoffs] So I'm finding.

36:16.708 --> 36:21.750
I guess I thought I did escape
with Aang and Katara and Sokka.

36:23.666 --> 36:25.833
It's kind of the first time
I've had friends.

36:27.041 --> 36:28.250
A new family.

36:29.541 --> 36:30.625
I guess so.

36:31.958 --> 36:35.625
I really, really don't want
to let them down.

36:35.708 --> 36:37.166
Oh. [sighs]

36:37.666 --> 36:40.375
You will. Eventually, in some way.

36:40.458 --> 36:42.833
But if you've chosen your friends well,

36:43.666 --> 36:45.083
they'll understand.

36:45.166 --> 36:46.458
What if they don't?

36:47.833 --> 36:48.875
Because of who I am.

36:48.958 --> 36:51.041
You worry too much about your surname.

36:52.250 --> 36:54.375
My parents were not good people either.

36:55.375 --> 36:56.583
Who were your parents?

36:56.666 --> 36:57.625
[Kyoshi sighs]

36:59.333 --> 37:00.416
Exactly.

37:01.000 --> 37:01.958
[laughs]

37:08.458 --> 37:09.375
[fox yelps]

37:22.916 --> 37:24.208
Am I supposed to pull that?

37:28.750 --> 37:30.666
[clanking]

37:31.708 --> 37:33.708
[dramatic music playing]

38:27.375 --> 38:28.833
[Sokka] It's not you, is it?

38:31.541 --> 38:35.791
I… I just thought if I looked hard enough,
I could see you.

38:36.416 --> 38:40.125
Or if… if I listened the right way,
I could hear you.

38:45.208 --> 38:47.583
Aang and Katara say I'm the plan man now.

38:49.708 --> 38:51.958
The person who comes up with a solution.

38:55.958 --> 38:58.916
If… if I had been this person

39:00.416 --> 39:01.541
back then,

39:03.333 --> 39:04.375
that day…

39:06.375 --> 39:07.750
could I have saved you?

39:14.583 --> 39:16.750
Or am I only this person now…

39:19.750 --> 39:20.958
because of you?

39:24.500 --> 39:27.416
-[Yangchen] You have to risk being hurt.
-[music fades]

39:27.500 --> 39:31.500
In my time, I was betrayed
by one of my closest friends.

39:32.000 --> 39:34.458
You didn't know Long Feng was a liar.

39:34.541 --> 39:36.541
You just knew you needed help.

39:37.291 --> 39:41.500
Without putting trust in others,
the weight of this role will crush you.

39:42.583 --> 39:45.250
But I thought I knew people.

39:46.000 --> 39:48.166
I thought I could see
if there was good in them.

39:48.250 --> 39:50.041
And, if I needed to,

39:51.583 --> 39:53.833
convince them to be good.

39:53.916 --> 39:55.083
[Yangchen scoffs]

39:55.166 --> 39:57.000
That's a lot to ask of yourself.

39:57.083 --> 39:59.375
You can't control other people.

39:59.458 --> 40:01.708
You can only control your own actions.

40:01.791 --> 40:03.708
Then my actions need to be better.

40:04.333 --> 40:06.375
I need to be so much better than I am.

40:07.458 --> 40:11.375
Every Avatar feels like
they're the most important Avatar

40:11.458 --> 40:12.666
that ever lived.

40:13.291 --> 40:15.250
But we all make mistakes.

40:16.416 --> 40:20.416
I thought I was so successful
at maintaining peace.

40:20.500 --> 40:25.708
But my actions angered the Spirit World,
and Avatar Kuruk paid a huge price.

40:26.291 --> 40:30.750
No Avatar can succeed
at balancing everything forever.

40:31.958 --> 40:35.083
That's why we'll always need
the next Avatar.

40:36.125 --> 40:37.083
Well,

40:38.000 --> 40:40.125
that's a little comforting.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.875
At least I know
if I don't accomplish everything,

40:42.958 --> 40:45.625
there will always be another one after me.

40:45.708 --> 40:47.041
Unless there isn't.

40:49.833 --> 40:51.916
When you're in the Avatar State,

40:52.000 --> 40:55.541
you're channeling the power
of all the previous Avatars.

40:56.125 --> 40:58.208
If you die in that state,

40:58.291 --> 41:00.625
the cycle will cease.

41:02.125 --> 41:05.000
No… reincarnation?

41:06.333 --> 41:08.625
The end of the Avatar forever.

41:08.708 --> 41:09.708
Correct.

41:10.708 --> 41:14.083
And the world will fall
out of balance forever.

41:18.291 --> 41:19.208
Well…

41:20.541 --> 41:21.791
Fine. It's fine.

41:21.875 --> 41:25.375
I can't really control it anyway,

41:25.458 --> 41:26.916
so I don't use it.

41:27.000 --> 41:28.000
Not yet.

41:28.541 --> 41:30.791
But as your mastery of the elements grows,

41:30.875 --> 41:34.125
your control of the Avatar State
grows too.

41:34.208 --> 41:37.916
First, bringing yourself into it
and out of it at will.

41:38.000 --> 41:39.375
Then precision.

41:39.458 --> 41:41.666
So now that I can waterbend and earthbend…

41:41.750 --> 41:44.416
You're probably stronger than you know.

41:45.000 --> 41:46.000
So,

41:47.000 --> 41:50.458
I could use the Avatar State
against the Fire Nation.

41:50.958 --> 41:53.166
I could tell the king that's the plan
if I needed to.

41:53.250 --> 41:54.958
Aang, I implore you.

41:55.541 --> 41:57.750
Wield this power wisely.

41:58.250 --> 41:59.666
Stay alive.

42:03.500 --> 42:05.500
[Katara] It just started with a sick girl.

42:05.583 --> 42:09.833
She needed golden nettles,
and I couldn't risk being identified.

42:10.791 --> 42:12.500
Because it might look bad for Aang?

42:13.916 --> 42:15.875
He seems like he'd understand.

42:16.375 --> 42:18.000
I don't need him to, though.

42:19.291 --> 42:21.000
I don't need you to either.

42:23.583 --> 42:26.375
It's just something that I had to do.

42:29.125 --> 42:33.458
So you looked in the mirror,
decided to do something just for you,

42:33.958 --> 42:36.000
and you became a hero.

42:36.625 --> 42:38.041
A masked avenger?

42:38.541 --> 42:39.625
[laughs]

42:40.583 --> 42:43.083
I looked in the mirror
and became a lying thief.

42:44.250 --> 42:45.750
Useless to everyone.

42:49.333 --> 42:51.833
You had your money. You could've gone.

42:52.750 --> 42:55.875
But you came with us
because you do wanna help.

42:56.375 --> 42:59.666
You're still a freedom fighter,
whether you admit it or not.

43:00.708 --> 43:01.791
[Jet sighs]

43:15.541 --> 43:17.250
Is that the duke's helmet?

43:26.583 --> 43:27.666
[Jet sighs]

43:27.750 --> 43:29.750
[mysterious music playing]

43:31.375 --> 43:33.208
When the Fire Nation invaded,

43:34.916 --> 43:37.000
he was always the first one to volunteer.

43:39.583 --> 43:43.333
[sighs] He kept saying,
"I trained for this."

43:45.458 --> 43:46.458
We had.

43:47.750 --> 43:48.666
Kind of.

43:50.791 --> 43:52.000
We struck back.

43:53.000 --> 43:54.041
Insurgents.

43:54.541 --> 43:56.458
We knew every inch of the city,

43:56.541 --> 43:59.583
and we wouldn't let them move freely
without feeling our sting.

44:04.583 --> 44:05.666
One day…

44:07.875 --> 44:09.375
they were ready for us.

44:16.375 --> 44:19.541
There was an ambush,
and Pipsqueak and the Duke…

44:21.958 --> 44:24.416
I didn't see what happened to Pipsqueak,

44:24.916 --> 44:25.833
but…

44:28.333 --> 44:29.166
[sighs]

44:29.250 --> 44:32.000
…I picked up The Duke, and I ran.

44:35.291 --> 44:39.958
[voice breaking] I ran as far
and as fast as I could.

44:46.958 --> 44:49.583
By the time I stopped to check him…

44:53.791 --> 44:55.375
he was already cold.

44:59.541 --> 45:00.791
We were kids

45:01.833 --> 45:03.708
playing at war.

45:05.000 --> 45:07.041
And then a real war came.

45:08.916 --> 45:13.875
Every single one of them
would still be alive if they never met me.

45:13.958 --> 45:15.500
[panting]

45:15.583 --> 45:17.291
[Katara] It's not your fault.

45:18.666 --> 45:20.541
It's the Fire Nation's.

45:21.083 --> 45:22.166
And you know that.

45:24.166 --> 45:25.458
You did good.

45:25.541 --> 45:27.500
You taught them to stand up.

45:30.333 --> 45:32.750
They would love you for that, I'm sure.

45:37.291 --> 45:39.333
They're better off without me.

45:43.083 --> 45:44.500
Everyone is.

45:48.458 --> 45:50.208
[Toph] We are in serious trouble.

45:50.291 --> 45:52.208
There's this comet coming,

45:52.291 --> 45:55.250
and it's supposed to
supercharge the Firebenders.

45:55.333 --> 45:57.416
And we have to tell
the Earth King about it.

45:57.500 --> 46:00.666
But we have no proof
or any idea of when it's going to come.

46:00.750 --> 46:01.583
Yes, you do.

46:01.666 --> 46:02.750
No, I don't.

46:02.833 --> 46:04.708
You're holding the proof in your hands.

46:06.583 --> 46:09.250
The Great Comet came twice during my life.

46:09.333 --> 46:14.125
It does make Firebenders stronger,
but it also made my firebending stronger.

46:14.916 --> 46:16.916
A strong Avatar can maintain balance.

46:18.625 --> 46:21.416
So you… you put it all in here?

46:21.500 --> 46:22.375
Yes.

46:23.375 --> 46:25.916
I tracked the orbital cycle of the comet.

46:26.000 --> 46:28.458
So its arrival
should be simple to calculate.

46:28.958 --> 46:32.583
In fact, I tracked all periods when
other elements were stronger or weaker.

46:34.000 --> 46:35.375
Wait, so,

46:36.916 --> 46:40.625
is there a time
when Firebenders are weaker?

46:40.708 --> 46:45.541
Yes. During a solar eclipse,
or as they call it, the Day of Black Sun.

46:45.625 --> 46:46.583
[Toph sighs]

46:46.666 --> 46:49.333
They lose their bending entirely.

46:50.083 --> 46:53.583
[gasps] That's it! I have to go! I…

46:55.708 --> 46:57.583
Sokka! Sokka!

46:57.666 --> 46:59.416
-Sokka, we got it!
-[Sokka] What?

46:59.500 --> 47:01.708
We found the date of the comet
in Kyoshi's diary.

47:01.791 --> 47:04.666
The Firebenders are supercharged
by the comet, right?

47:04.750 --> 47:08.041
Well, they lose their bending entirely
on the day of a solar eclipse.

47:08.125 --> 47:09.458
They'll be helpless.

47:09.541 --> 47:11.583
If there's an eclipse
before the comet arrives--

47:11.666 --> 47:13.333
Then that's the day we attack.

47:16.166 --> 47:19.541
No way! This is the room
where we can figure that out.

47:19.625 --> 47:21.875
It tracks the movement
of everything in the sky.

47:21.958 --> 47:24.625
So if we test the dates
before the comet arrives

47:24.708 --> 47:28.500
and there's an eclipse,
we can kiss those ash-holes goodbye!

47:28.583 --> 47:29.500
Here!

47:32.291 --> 47:33.458
[Jet] Is this for real?

47:33.541 --> 47:34.791
[Katara] What do you mean?

47:34.875 --> 47:36.041
Today.

47:36.666 --> 47:37.833
Right now.

47:38.416 --> 47:41.416
We might actually find a way
to beat the Fire Nation?

47:42.166 --> 47:43.375
We have a shot.

47:47.333 --> 47:48.458
Thanks to you.

47:50.625 --> 47:52.083
[dramatic music playing]

48:07.333 --> 48:08.708
[squeaks]

48:08.791 --> 48:09.958
[Appa grunts]

48:10.958 --> 48:12.958
[chittering]

48:14.958 --> 48:16.791
[Appa grunts]

48:16.875 --> 48:18.875
-[explosion]
-[Appa grunting]

48:19.625 --> 48:21.625
[Momo chittering]

48:28.833 --> 48:30.833
[mysterious music playing]

49:33.375 --> 49:34.958
[Momo chittering]

49:35.041 --> 49:36.583
[Appa grunting]

49:53.666 --> 49:54.666
[Iroh] Zuko?

50:01.458 --> 50:02.583
I had him.

50:07.833 --> 50:09.208
But I couldn't do it.

50:13.833 --> 50:14.708
I've got you.

50:15.208 --> 50:16.291
I've got you.

50:23.458 --> 50:25.916
[Zei] Mr. Great Librarian?

50:26.000 --> 50:27.208
[Wan Shi Tong] Mmm.

50:27.291 --> 50:29.458
What is it, scholar?

50:29.541 --> 50:30.833
[Zei] I understand now.

50:31.666 --> 50:34.083
Why you took this place
from the human world.

50:35.416 --> 50:36.958
We're infected with

50:38.208 --> 50:39.458
ignorance,

50:40.000 --> 50:41.041
greed,

50:41.541 --> 50:42.791
and power lust.

50:45.666 --> 50:46.875
So, um…

50:50.958 --> 50:53.250
that's why I have to inform you

50:54.458 --> 50:56.583
of a violation of the rules.

50:58.458 --> 51:01.458
[suspenseful music swells]

51:02.041 --> 51:04.583
-[Katara] How far out are we?
-[Sokka] From today?

51:11.583 --> 51:12.500
Look.

51:13.166 --> 51:14.416
At what?

51:20.333 --> 51:21.625
The eclipse.

51:22.208 --> 51:25.666
I can't believe it! We have it!
The Day of Black Sun! We know it!

51:25.750 --> 51:27.000
[chuckles]

51:27.083 --> 51:30.458
[Wan Shi Tong] I knew
you couldn't be trusted.

51:31.250 --> 51:33.958
Wait, no. You don't understand.

51:34.541 --> 51:37.541
This isn't about hurting people.
It's about saving lives.

51:37.625 --> 51:40.625
Saving your lives through war!

51:40.708 --> 51:43.625
Wait a minute. How did you even find out?

51:45.625 --> 51:47.875
[Wan Shi Tong] He informed me
of your wrongdoing

51:47.958 --> 51:52.208
in exchange for access to this library
for all eternity.

51:52.291 --> 51:53.458
[Aang] Professor?

51:54.083 --> 51:55.250
How could you?

51:55.333 --> 51:57.041
You broke your promise.

51:57.125 --> 52:01.541
Unfortunately, Professor,
you may not enjoy eternity much.

52:01.625 --> 52:02.708
What?

52:02.791 --> 52:05.833
You used what you learned here
to harm your friends.

52:05.916 --> 52:08.750
You'll be the first to pay the price!

52:09.791 --> 52:11.291
[screeches]

52:11.375 --> 52:14.250
No! I'm a scholar, like you!

52:16.666 --> 52:18.000
-Run!
-Go!

52:18.666 --> 52:21.208
[tense music swells]

52:22.791 --> 52:24.500
[Appa grunts]

52:29.416 --> 52:31.375
[Appa groans]

52:31.458 --> 52:33.250
[tense music playing]

52:33.333 --> 52:34.916
[Appa groans]

52:36.875 --> 52:38.291
[Momo screams]

52:39.958 --> 52:41.458
[Appa squeals]

52:50.916 --> 52:52.541
Toph, go! We're right behind you!

52:59.375 --> 53:01.291
You will not elude me!

53:01.375 --> 53:04.666
Don't you see? We're just trying
to protect the people that we love!

53:04.750 --> 53:08.833
And I am protecting what I love!

53:13.125 --> 53:14.250
No, no, no, no, no!

53:16.416 --> 53:17.916
No, no, no, no!

53:19.333 --> 53:20.500
No, come on!

53:23.416 --> 53:24.416
Okay!

53:26.250 --> 53:27.083
No!

53:28.250 --> 53:30.458
No! Come on!

53:32.166 --> 53:33.625
Stop sinking!

53:33.708 --> 53:35.541
[Appa grunting]

53:35.625 --> 53:38.708
Appa, help me! [grunts]

53:38.791 --> 53:40.791
[Appa grunting]

53:44.250 --> 53:47.875
[Toph grunts] Hey! Get away from him!

53:47.958 --> 53:49.083
[grunts]

53:50.000 --> 53:52.291
No! No! Got it!

53:57.750 --> 53:58.583
[grunts]

53:59.083 --> 54:01.083
[screeches]

54:02.958 --> 54:04.041
Come on!

54:06.208 --> 54:07.458
[Wan Shi Tong screeches]

54:07.958 --> 54:09.458
-What now?
-I'll distract him.

54:09.541 --> 54:11.500
The rest of you, get past him and get out.

54:11.583 --> 54:12.500
No.

54:13.041 --> 54:13.875
I'll do it.

54:14.916 --> 54:16.916
You can't fight him.
No, we'll figure it out.

54:17.000 --> 54:18.875
Katara, do me a favor.

54:24.583 --> 54:26.375
[wings flapping]

54:27.875 --> 54:30.041
[screeches]

54:30.125 --> 54:31.583
Kill them all.

54:34.833 --> 54:36.208
[Sokka] Katara, come on. Get up.

54:36.291 --> 54:37.958
Time to trim those feathers!

54:39.166 --> 54:40.833
[screeches]

54:40.916 --> 54:42.375
[dramatic music playing]

54:43.541 --> 54:45.166
[screeches]

54:54.416 --> 54:55.958
Heave off, insect!

54:56.041 --> 54:56.916
[Jet grunts]

54:57.500 --> 54:58.750
[gasps]

55:00.875 --> 55:01.750
[groans]

55:03.875 --> 55:05.750
[Appa groaning]

55:05.833 --> 55:08.000
Leave him alone!

55:09.333 --> 55:10.416
[grunts]

55:10.500 --> 55:11.708
No!

55:11.791 --> 55:13.458
[grunts]

55:14.291 --> 55:16.208
[Appa grunts]

55:16.291 --> 55:17.291
No!

55:20.833 --> 55:22.541
I'm sorry, Appa!

55:24.375 --> 55:25.666
[grunts]

55:25.750 --> 55:27.791
-[Appa groans]
-[Toph grunts]

55:28.416 --> 55:30.416
[mysterious music playing]

55:33.208 --> 55:34.750
[screeching]

55:39.958 --> 55:42.083
[groaning]

55:46.375 --> 55:47.666
[grunts]

55:49.333 --> 55:51.333
[dramatic music playing]

55:52.625 --> 55:54.125
[screeching]

56:04.708 --> 56:05.625
[gasps]

56:06.666 --> 56:08.083
[screeching]

56:21.083 --> 56:22.250
[mystical whirring]

56:22.333 --> 56:23.166
[gasps]

56:23.250 --> 56:24.375
[Katara] Jet!

56:24.458 --> 56:26.333
Jet! We have to get him out somehow!

56:26.416 --> 56:28.500
-How?
-I don't know how! We have to go back in!

56:28.583 --> 56:30.083
-How do we get him out?
-No!

56:30.833 --> 56:33.166
No! No, he's gone.

56:33.250 --> 56:36.250
[somber music playing]

56:40.166 --> 56:41.500
He saved us all.

56:41.583 --> 56:43.166
[Katara breathing shakily]

56:43.666 --> 56:44.791
[gasps]

56:47.666 --> 56:48.625
Wait.

56:49.916 --> 56:51.166
Where's Appa?

56:53.458 --> 56:54.708
Appa?

56:55.833 --> 56:57.083
Where are you, buddy?

56:58.250 --> 56:59.583
Appa!

56:59.666 --> 57:01.875
[Momo whimpering]

57:01.958 --> 57:03.208
Momo?

57:05.083 --> 57:06.250
[Aang] Appa!

57:06.333 --> 57:08.166
-Aang.
-[Aang] Toph, can you feel Appa?

57:08.250 --> 57:10.958
No! No, some people came,
and they took him! I…

57:11.041 --> 57:12.458
Took him where?

57:12.541 --> 57:16.000
I don't know! I was… I was…
Look, I tried to stop them!

57:16.083 --> 57:18.000
-[Sokka] Who took him? Aang?
-[Toph] I don't know!

57:18.083 --> 57:18.958
Appa!

57:19.041 --> 57:20.208
Aang.

57:20.291 --> 57:21.916
[echoing] Appa!

57:22.000 --> 57:23.958
[dramatic music swells]

57:24.833 --> 57:26.833
[wind whistling]

57:28.750 --> 57:30.666
[adventurous music playing]

59:37.750 --> 59:40.458
[music fades]
